Enhancement: Support Multi-Bucket Application Keys in the `b2` backend

The `b2` backend now supports Backblaze B2 Multi-Bucket Application Keys,
including single-bucket keys created through the multi-bucket API (for
example by the Backblaze Terraform provider).

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/5741
